; Refuse to install under any Node version other than the one in `engines` (22.x, the CI's).
; ⚠ WHAT THIS DOES NOT CATCH: `engine-strict` governs INSTALLATION only. An `npx vitest` launched
; under another version still passes — that is exactly how a golden once got baselined under Node 23
; while CI runs under Node 22 (cf. `src/ui/format.ts`, the ICU coupling).
; The complete guardrail, should the need come back, is a version assertion in the Vitest setup;
; it was not added here because it was not asked for.
engine-strict=true
